@model IEnumerable<Librarian.Cards.Card>

@{
    Layout = "_Layout";
}

<div class="block" id="message"></div>
<form class="box"
      hx-post="/cards/refinements"
      hx-target="#message"
      hx-swap="innerHTML">
    <h1 class="title">Refine with ChatGPT</h1>
    <div class="field">
        <p>Use the prompt below to improve the translation and find examples of how the words are used.</p>
        <p>Copy the answer and paste it into the text field.</p>
        <label>Prompt</label>
        <div class="control">
<textarea class="textarea" 
          id="prompt"
          rows="30"
          readonly
          style="font-family: monospace"
>Hi ChatGPT, I’ll provide a list of Norwegian words with their part of speech in brackets.
Some of the words may contain one or multiple inflections in parentheses; use only one, preferably the most common one.
For each word, write the translation and create a sentence using the word in Norwegian, then translate this sentence into English.
The Norwegian language here refers to Norwegian Bokmål, and the English translation should be in British English.
Output the result in the following format:
```json
[
    {
        "id": <word ID as int>,
        "no": <word or phrase in Norwegian>,
        "en": <word or phrase in English>,
        "example-no": <Usage sentence in Norwegian>,
        "example-en": <Translated usage sentence in English>
    }
]
```
Example of input:
-123 å gå [Verb](Inf), 2456 får [Verb](Pres)
Example of output:
[
    {
        "id": -123,
        "no": "å gå",
        "en": "to go",
        "example-no": "Jeg vil å gå hjem",
        "example-en": "I want to go home"
    },
    {
        "id": 2456,
        "no": "får",
        "en": "gets",
        "example-no": "Jeg får nok penger",
        "example-en": "I get enough money"
    }
]

Here is a list of words to process:
@string.Join(", ", @Model.Select( static x => $"{x.Id} {x.Phrase} [{x.PartOfSpeech}] ({string.Join(", ", x.Tags)})"))</textarea>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
        <div class="control">
            <button class="button" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('prompt').value)">
                Copy to Clipboard
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
        <div class="control">
            <textarea class="textarea" name="prompt-response"></textarea> 
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
        <div class="control">
            <button class="button" type="submit">
                Update Word List
            </button>
        </div>
    </div> 
</form>